        <mxCell id="TnW4fBOS_iKetNsBtfqp-9" value="Originally wanted to use EnvLogger, but it isn&#39;t meant for conditional writing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;It &quot;fires and forgets&quot;, while our requirement is something that prompts before writing.&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;(extending envlogger makes little sense since its responsibility is just dumping everything).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Hence we will write it ourselves =)!&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1">
